---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — OnlineCheckPrinter"
  description="How OnlineCheckPrinter.com handles your personal information."
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 py-12">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 mb-6">Privacy Policy</h1>

    <div class="prose-article">
      <p>
        This Privacy Policy explains how <strong>OnlineCheckPrinter.com</strong> ("we,"
        "us," or "our") collects, uses, and discloses information about you when you visit
        our website.
      </p>

      <h2>Information we collect</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>
          <strong>Usage data.</strong> When you visit the site, we may collect anonymized
          analytics data such as pages visited, approximate location (country/region), device
          type, and referring URL. We use a privacy-respecting analytics provider that does
          not track you across other websites.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Email addresses.</strong> If you subscribe to our newsletter or contact us
          directly, we collect the email address you provide. We use this only to respond to
          you or send the content you requested.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Cookies.</strong> We may use essential cookies for site functionality and,
          with your consent, cookies from affiliate networks to attribute clicks and
          commissions.
        </li>
      </ul>

      <h2>How we use information</h2>

      <ul>
        <li>To operate, maintain, and improve the site.</li>
        <li>To respond to inquiries and send requested content.</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
        <li>To attribute affiliate clicks to our account (see our <a href="/disclosure">disclosure</a>).</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Third-party services</h2>

      <p>
        When you click an affiliate link on this site, you may be redirected to a third-party
        website whose privacy practices we do not control. Please read their privacy policies
        separately.
      </p>

      <h2>Your rights</h2>

      <p>
        Depending on your jurisdiction (including the EU's GDPR and California's CCPA), you
        may have the right to access, correct, delete, or export the personal information we
        hold about you. To exercise these rights, contact us at
        <a href="mailto:hello@onlinecheckprinter.com">hello@onlinecheckprinter.com</a>.
      </p>

      <h2>Children</h2>

      <p>
        This site is not directed at children under 13 and we do not knowingly collect
        personal information from children.
      </p>

      <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>

      <p>
        We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. The "last updated" date below
        will reflect any changes.
      </p>

      <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-10">Last updated: August 2026.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
